{"summary":"Draft dice in Sagrada to construct your stained glass window masterpiece.","description":"Bring your stained glass masterpiece to dazzling digital life in Sagrada, the dice-drafting board game from Floodgate Games.\n\nTake turns selecting colorful dice and placing them in your gorgeous stained-glass window. The artisan who creates the most beautiful window wins.\n\nChoose your dice carefully!\nFind the perfect fit for each piece of your window: restrictions on both the color and number showing on your die make for a puzzling challenge.\n\nUse your tools!\nAs a master artisan, your tools-of-the-trade will help you shape the dice available.\n\nPlease your admirers!\nAdapt to the fickle demands of your patrons -- while keeping your signature artistic flair -- for additional prestige.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fGiT31pogmw?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4cdKEmYx67TO083Yq4n0UYDXlWAcA6T6lUZT7VMg6qagAAoTS4eAMvTvRreD0y4vfZlMOqIMaV4NVXRzTmhOB8E","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BnIjMzqCL9yXdj9uUbNFdBb8V9DVYK3d0uJZQDimhtcdjyu8Nb2B6e5cuaUxefnCmZSWMiEjJAfre_i9vCSvyA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ngpHQpQHB4u8VdHH3hEHj7vkDv9bl88vtCSa-TwF3gZR7yuyLtp91fbrXbG0Pa8NTMmpCy0jroZGYRNVVueMUoQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YFTp0dEHj3CNlZvgzV6o_RLy6ATvVOy3NmKgnQwJi6mAh6rcBFz4RQGfkmL0zuShcvrVvA765peswEPa8TpI3A","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UZHpxXjfHgvSjRJ0P6V0B03rjAl4fZcke_jfTiDw19b9RDjrcshmMLR6vA5Ur6px8ckei2KLYM6-cuIz_8GZEA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5wbv0yh2s-J1yk_smqtetTxLCbGbvS5BMRzhlUAF_K0GXnXgULHUpZjdI3CyzT_jkUUOeuBECPkhrAmU_XwQISY","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XK5JyVxckOmEOD4ZeTeYlhYfX4X0NdhU2GRJZOlT2qeGXnNgdNIBN9YL566nfS6Zje5YJUxH0UPhRjbIRPdQqw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ELLIWlSKmJ-YBPO_TcmxmbCxqfO3mov1pJ2AQOcx6XHqQbBm9lyTGEBuWiiKqAq_13WA4hG3_er8r4KxseLxkg","https://pla